## A deck:  the 52 cards of a US standard deck, ace of clubs first -- and its two jokers, if you ask
// It reads the card's own suits and ranks:  `card suits`, `card ranks`.
a "deck" is a list of cards where:
	// no jokers, unless it's made `with jokers`
	- its "jokers" is yes or no

	// a new deck holds one of each card, ace of clubs first, then its two jokers, red then black
	- to create it:
		for each rank in card ranks
			for each suit in card suits
				// `the deck`, not `it`:  in a `for each`, `it` is the loop's item, here the suit
				add (a new card with rank = the rank, suit = the suit) to the deck
		if its jokers is yes
			add (a new joker with color = red) to the deck
			add (a new joker with color = black) to the deck

	// echo its cards' short names, top to bottom
	- to display it:
		set card names to a new list of text
		for each card in the deck
			add the short name of the card to card names
		echo "deck: " + card names


## Tests
to test deck creation
	the deck is a new deck
	the number of cards in the deck should be 52
	set the queens to the cards in the deck where the rank of the card is queen
	the number of cards in the queens should be 4
	the name of the top card of the deck should be "ace-of-clubs"
	the name of the bottom card of the deck should be "king-of-spades"
	the short name of the top card of the deck should be "A♣️"
	the first card of the deck is the ace of clubs should be yes

	echo "the deck before shuffling:"
	display the deck
	shuffle the deck
	the number of cards in the deck should be 52
	echo "the deck after shuffling:"
	display the deck

to test deck with jokers
	the deck is a new deck with jokers
	the number of cards in the deck should be 54
	set wild cards to the cards in the deck where it is a joker
	the number of cards in wild cards should be 2
	the first card of the deck is the ace of clubs should be yes
	// the red joker, then the black one, last
	the last card of the deck is the black joker should be yes
	the name of the bottom card of the deck should be "black-joker"
